WDDX: the wddx_* functions, which serialize PHP values to WDDX packets
(the XML of the Web Distributed Data eXchange) and back, and the wddx
serializer of the session module, with libxml2 of the package az.
PHP 7.4 moved the module out of PHP, to PECL.

The module wddx of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/wddx.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/wddx.
